# Local build output
build/
out/
.kotlin/
launcher/.kotlin/

# Game artifacts pulled off the device for offline analysis.
# Proprietary, ~92MB, and reproducible from the installed game; only the digests
# belong in the repository. See docs/thetower-6000.md.
TheTower/
Unlock/

# Stray runtime log pulled from a device run.
LogOutput.log

# Packages rebuilt locally: scripts/build_il2cppinterop.sh
/local-nuget/

# Test output that used to be committed. scripts/ci_failure_notice.sh wrote
# its report to ./failure.body instead of the file it hands to gh, so the stub
# run left a plausible-looking failure record in the tree and it was committed by
# accident. The script is fixed; this is here so a regression cannot land again.
/failure.body
